            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lovestohost"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This recipe is like a blank canvas...a good jumping off point to customize the dressing to your taste. I was looking for a caesar dressing to use for a salad and this one needed a \"face\", so I gave it a whirl. As written, it's very mayo-y and kind of bland, but it would be easy to doctor to suit your tastes. I used it with \"Carrot Pepperoni Caesar Salad\" from this site and the blandness worked well there, but I would not have enjoyed it, as is, on a regular salad. THANKS for the recipe, shmu!",
